Problem - II:

Developing an ethical dashboard:

Design a GUI where a user can choose a dataset, choose a model, choose an ethical metric, and see the results, whether they are ethically correct or not.

Datasets: Law, COMPAS, Adult, German credit card
Model: classical & deep models, including LLMs
Metrics: you can make category - fairness, privacy, robustness, and explainability


Components required:
    1. Datasets
    2. Base Models
    3. Metric Computations
    a. Fairness Metrics
    b. Privacy Metrics
    c. Robustness Metrics
    d. Explainability Metrics


Backbone:
    Streamlit Application - Tornado webserver
    Hosted on Streamlit cloud/AWS/Azure


